OL,3,ASpreadsheets, group chats and plain old
OL,4,Agood luck: Glastonbury's ticket
OL,5,Ascramble begins
OL,6,
OL,7,FThousands of music lovers are sitting
OL,8,Fby their laptops and phones ready to
OL,9,Fsecure tickets for Glastonbury 2027
OL,11,FThe sale goes live at 09:00 BST and
OL,12,Ffestival hopefuls will be able to
OL,13,Fsecure up to six tickets - the first
OL,14,Fbatch sold out in less than 30 minutes
OL,15,Fon Thursday
OL,17,FOrganisers have warned buyers not to
OL,18,Fuse multiple tabs or refresh the page
OL,19,Fwhile they try to get through the queue
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
