OL,3,ASpreadsheets, group chats and plain old
OL,4,Agood luck: Glastonbury's ticket
OL,5,Ascramble begins
OL,6,
OL,7,FA new queuing system was introduced
OL,8,Fthis year means each registered
OL,9,Fattendee only gets one place in the
OL,10,Fline - one festival veteran says "it's
OL,11,Fliterally a lottery"
OL,13,FTickets to Britain's biggest music
OL,14,Ffestival now cost more than #400
OL,15,F($528). In 1970, the event cost #1 and
OL,16,Fincluded a free pint of milk from
OL,17,FWorthy Farm
